  "body": "- synchronised some dependencies\r\n- moved to caret-everywhere to avoid needing to sync with transitive dependencies\r\n- made \"downgrade legacy\" script more resilient\r\n\r\nTo verify\r\n- all build output is identical\r\n- all tests and scripts run identical as before\r\n\r\nA gauge of the impact (200MB install size it seems):\r\n\r\nbefore:\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ find . -type d -name node_modules -prune | tr '\\n' '\\0' |  xargs -0 du -sch\r\n  0B    ./specs/node_modules\r\n2.4G    ./node_modules\r\n  0B    ./tests/utils/node_modules\r\n2.8M    ./tests/e2e/node_modules\r\n  0B    ./examples/js/tourism/node_modules\r\n  0B    ./examples/js/getting-started/node_modules\r\n  0B    ./examples/js/e-commerce/node_modules\r\n8.6M    ./examples/js/server-rendering/node_modules\r\n  0B    ./examples/js/calendar-widget/node_modules\r\n  0B    ./examples/js/media/node_modules\r\n 10M    ./examples/vue/ssr/node_modules\r\n7.4M    ./examples/vue/getting-started/node_modules\r\n 18M    ./examples/vue/e-commerce/node_modules\r\n4.3M    ./examples/vue/nuxt/node_modules\r\n 19M    ./examples/vue/default-theme/node_modules\r\n 15M    ./examples/vue/media/node_modules\r\n 16M    ./examples/react-hooks/next/node_modules\r\n 16M    ./examples/react-hooks/next-routing/node_modules\r\n110M    ./examples/react-hooks/react-native/node_modules\r\n3.3M    ./examples/react-hooks/ssr/node_modules\r\n  0B    ./examples/react-hooks/getting-started/node_modules\r\n  0B    ./examples/react-hooks/e-commerce/node_modules\r\n  0B    ./examples/react-hooks/default-theme/node_modules\r\n 75M    ./examples/react/next/node_modules\r\n3.4M    ./examples/react/tourism/node_modules\r\n 79M    ./examples/react/autocomplete/node_modules\r\n 25M    ./examples/react/react-native/node_modules\r\n 17M    ./examples/react/react-native-query-suggestions/node_modules\r\n6.5M    ./examples/react/server-side-rendering/node_modules\r\n4.6M    ./examples/react/multi-index/node_modules\r\n  0B    ./examples/reac